Subject: [PATCH] ath12k: close and drain group producers before host teardown

Separate core/pdev/DP obligations from started and borrower references.
Keep control responses alive through unregister and mode-off, and retain
HAL pointer DMA when DS refuses DP release. Stop bus callback producers
before unassign; synchronize CE work and retry timers before ring cleanup.

